> seen a handful of ascensions in this group that used this method. It's
> just cheating if you ask me.

No, it's clearly not cheating (if you ask me ;-) (More likely cheap than
a cheat.)

I don't think that how that helmet works is implemented by accident; it's
too apparent to do that and the HoOA exists for quite some time in Nethack
(at least since 3.0.9, which must be more than 13 years now).

Though _you_ may always abstain from ascending this way if you don't like
that. (As _I_ abstain from wishing for artifacts; which is also no cheat.)

Also consider that if you are Neutral and land on the wrong altar you
have 50:50 chance to get the right alignment. If you failed you have to
uncurse the helmet and retry. If you are Chaotic or Lawful and you land
on a Neutral altar you must always head to the next one. And you must
*have* the helmet, i.e. wish for it or be lucky to find one.

